503
00:22:53.832 --> 00:22:54.832
I am.

504
00:22:54.833 --> 00:22:56.626
How good are you? Like for real. how good?

505
00:22:56.627 --> 00:22:57.835
Like. really good.

506
00:22:57.836 --> 00:22:59.921
- Hmm. like. really. really good?
- [chuckles]

507
00:22:59.922 --> 00:23:02.299
