Look. there's still more golf. right?

521
00:23:39.670 --> 00:23:40.670
Back nine.

522
00:23:40.671 --> 00:23:43.422
Okay. So. get out there
and show them what's up.

523
00:23:43.423 --> 00:23:45.843
- Own it.
- [chuckles]

524
00:23:47.553 --> 00:23:49.220
