- I do.

536
00:24:10.450 --> 00:24:12.077
Okay. [chuckles]

537
00:24:12.744 --> 00:24:13.829
[clears throat]

538
00:24:16.248 --> 00:24:17.290
[sighs]

539
00:24:17.291 --> 00:24:18.708
