541
00:24:20.252 --> 00:24:22.962
Hey. it's me.
We might need to skip out on this.

542
00:24:22.963 --> 00:24:25.256
Now there's a maintenance entrance
off the 14th hole.

543
00:24:25.257 --> 00:24:27.592
