- [scoffs]

559
00:26:09.444 --> 00:26:11.654
[crowd exclaiming]

560
00:26:11.655 --> 00:26:13.240
[groans] Come on.

561
00:26:25.252 --> 00:26:26.378
[groans]

562
00:26:27.504 --> 00:26:28.714
Come on.

563
00:26:39.766 --> 00:26:41.934
- Yes.
- [crowd applauding]

564
00:26:41.935 --> 00:26:43.228
[groans]

565
00:26:57.201 --> 00:26:58.452
